! =========================================================
! 2D Script - plan symbol
! HOTSPOT2 without id = non-editable reference corners so
! the circular footprint is framed but not drag-conflicted.
! PROJECT2 derives the plan from the 3D spiral geometry.
! =========================================================
HOTSPOT2 0, 0
HOTSPOT2 A, 0
HOTSPOT2 0, B
HOTSPOT2 A, B
PROJECT2 3, 270, 2
